{"figure_id":"F06","title":"條件情境：頻率、班距規律性與車上時間的不同作用","caption":"全表 54 組明示條件，沒有對應實際路線。等待 = 平均班距 × (1+CV²)／2；增班時班距除以頻率倍數、CV固定。\n固定步行 8 分鐘、原車上 20 分鐘；右圖按實際參數組合列出總時間，沒有把車上變化套到步行或候車。\n假設乘客獨立隨機到站、服務穩定且可上首車。未估持留乘客成本、滿載拒乘或接駁損失；不是政策實際效果或投資排序。","period_label":"假設參數組合，無實測營運期間","denominator":{"probability_assumption":"independent_uniform_time_arrivals","scenario_rows":54},"tables":[{"table_id":"F06-conditional-scenarios","title":"班距、規律性與車上時間情境","columns":[{"key":"scenario_id","label":"情境 ID","unit":"","description":"固定參數組合的識別碼，不是實際公車路線。"},{"key":"baseline_mean_headway_min","label":"原平均班距","unit":"分鐘","description":"情境設定的原平均到車間隔。"},{"key":"headway_cv","label":"班距變異係數","unit":"","description":"班距標準差除以平均班距；0 表示完全等間隔。"},{"key":"frequency_factor","label":"頻率倍數","unit":"倍","description":"相對原車輛頻率的倍率；不等於車速倍數。"},{"key":"vehicle_reduction","label":"車上減時比例","unit":"比例","description":"固定原車上時間的假設縮短比例。"},{"key":"wait_min","label":"預期候車","unit":"分鐘","description":"按平均班距與變異計算的條件候車時間。"},{"key":"total_min","label":"條件旅程時間","unit":"分鐘","description":"假設步行、候車及車上時間之和。"},{"key":"saving_vs_same_cv_baseline_min","label":"相同規律性下節省","unit":"分鐘","description":"與同 CV 的原班距、原車上時間情境比較。"}],"rows":[{"scenario_id":"H5-CV0-F1-V0","baseline_mean_headway_min":5,"headway_cv":0.0,"frequency_factor":1.0,"vehicle_reduction":0.0,"mean_headway_min":5.0,"frequency_vehicles_per_hour":12.0,"wait_min":2.5,"excess_wait_vs_regular_min":0.0,"access_min":8,"vehicle_min":20,"total_min":30.5,"saving_vs_same_cv_baseline_min":0.0,"holding_cost_min":null,"evidence_kind":"conditional_scenario","actual_route_id":null,"_id":"F06-conditional-scenarios:0","_links":[]},{"scenario_id":"H5-CV0-F1-V0.1","baseline_mean_headway_min":5,"headway_cv":0.0,"frequency_factor":1.0,"vehicle_reduction":0.1,"mean_headway_min":5.0,"frequency_vehicles_per_hour":12.0,"wait_min":2.5,"excess_wait_vs_regular_min":0.0,"access_min":8,"vehicle_min":18,"total_min":28.5,"saving_vs_same_cv_baseline_min":2.0,"holding_cost_min":null,"evidence_kind":"conditional_scenar